# Native Bluetooth Scan with the agent's prompts (task 014 P3c), release build, on-screen keyboard forced. The fake
# BlueZ (src/harness_services.cpp) finds, besides the paired devices: a phone (numeric comparison), a keyboard (a
# passkey shown here and typed there), an old headset (PIN 0000), a tablet (passkey), two unnamed devices (hidden by
# Named Only) and a speaker with a very long name.
# Shots: the scan list (the Scan toggle, the devices with their state or signal), the PIN dialog with the number pad
# and 0000 typed (its buttons gone: the pad's Enter / Esc act), paired ("Paired with Old headset", the highlight kept
# on it through the fresh discovery), the phone's pairing code to confirm (No / Yes), paired, the code to type on the
# keyboard (OK), paired once it was typed, and the Scan toggle off.
# Review only: no golden; headers checked against the home grid's (run.sh header).
title settings native bluetooth scan
review
env APPLAUNCH_SETTINGS_UI native
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK force
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home ZERO
launch Settings
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1000
# Scan (row 5)
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 2500
shot bt_scan
header bt_scan "Settings > Bluetooth > Scan" "Bluetooth > Scan" Scan
# rows: Scan, M4 keyboard, Studio headphones..., Car kit, Field phone, Pocket keyboard, Old headset, Tablet, Garden...
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
tapkey 0
tapkey 0
tapkey 0
tapkey 0
shot bt_pin
# the device titles the PIN dialog; at 480x320 and 640x480 that title shows in the header (cp0_ui_dialog.h step 3)
header bt_pin "Settings > Bluetooth > Scan" "Bluetooth > Scan" Scan "Old headset"
tapkey ENTER
wait 3000
shot bt_pin_paired
header bt_pin_paired "Settings > Bluetooth > Scan" "Bluetooth > Scan" Scan
# the phone (two rows up): its pairing code, Yes
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot bt_confirm
key ENTER
wait 3000
shot bt_confirm_paired
# the keyboard (next row): the code to type on it, then it is typed there
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot bt_display
btkeytyped
wait 3000
shot bt_display_paired
# the Scan toggle (row 0) off
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot bt_scan_off
header bt_scan_off "Settings > Bluetooth > Scan" "Bluetooth > Scan" Scan
